      "briefTitle": "Study Comparing Ticagrelor With Aspirin for Prevention of Vascular Events in Patients Undergoing CABG",
      "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Parallel Group, Double-Blind Study of Ticagrelor Compared With Aspirin for Prevention of Vascular Events in Patients Undergoing Coronary Artery Bypass Graft Operation TiCAB- Ticagrelor in CABG",
